{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112772","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112772/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112772/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112772/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112772","id":3626695267,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6zg5Fc","number":112772,"title":"Editor: Add indication to properties that have invalid values","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-11-14T18:25:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T09:32:13Z","closed_at":"2026-07-13T09:27:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112772","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112772","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112772.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112772.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"* Fixes #75555.\r\n\r\nExport annotations/hints allow you to impose restrictions on Inspector fields, making manual setting of certain values ​​impossible. However, you can still accidentally have invalid property values ​​(for example, if you forgot to initialize an `int` or `float` variable, and its range doesn't include `0` or `0.0`). The current behavior of the Inspector can be misleading, as it displays incorrect values.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@export_enum(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\") var enum_1\r\n@export_enum(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\") var enum_2: int = 42\r\n\r\n@export_range(10, 20, 1) var range_int_1: int = -100\r\n@export_range(10, 20, 1) var range_int_2: int = +100\r\n\r\n@export_range(1.0, 2.0, 0.1) var range_float_1: float = NAN\r\n@export_range(1.0, 2.0, 0.1) var range_float_2: float = -INF\r\n@export_range(1.0, 2.0, 0.1) var range_float_3: float = +INF\r\n@export_range(1.0, 2.0, 0.1) var range_float_4: float = -10.0\r\n@export_range(1.0, 2.0, 0.1) var range_float_5: float = +10.0\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"554\" height=\"304\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b5bc9de-b2ce-4407-b85b-2a9abe5d9a6b\" />\r\n\r\nSee also:\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10068\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/88354\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105911\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106019\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112772/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112772/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}